Package: ragnar-skald
Version: 0.1.1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libpipewire-0.3-0t64, libgtk-4-1, wireplumber
Recommends: swh-plugins, rubberband-ladspa, librnnoise-ladspa
Maintainer: LieraOS
Description: PipeWire audio control center for LieraOS
 Native GTK4/Wayland audio settings: output/input devices,
 volume with optional 150% boost, mute, effect chains
 (EQ, echo, reverb) and microphone processing (voice presets,
 noise suppression, echo) via PipeWire filter-chain modules.
 Persistent effects run through the ragnar-skald-fx daemon.
